-- ============================================================
-- No hand-written seed data.
--
-- Subtopics ("hot topics") are auto-generated by story clustering
-- over ingested articles + posts: run `npm run ingest` (clustering
-- runs automatically afterwards) or `npm run cluster` directly.
-- The 7 general_topics are seeded by schema.sql and act as background
-- metadata only. Dev users/posts: `npm run seed:dev`.
-- ============================================================
